{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history anchor\" data-cite=\"SMC 1.01.010\" data-history=\"/SMC/1.01.010/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.010\" id=\"1.01.010\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/SMC/1.01.010/search\" data-share=\"/SMC/1.01.010/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 421px; min-height: 64px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.010</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Adoption.\">Adoption.</span></h6></header>\n<p>Pursuant to the provisions of Sections <span class=\"notcite\">50022.1</span> through <span class=\"notcite\">50022.8</span> and <span class=\"notcite\">50022.10</span> of the California Code Annotated, there is adopted the “Sonoma Municipal Code”, together with those secondary codes adopted by reference as authorized by the California <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(S)\">State</a> Legislature, save and except those portions of the secondary codes as are deleted or modified by the provisions of the “Sonoma Municipal Code”. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 496 § 1, 1975).</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.1", "node_id": "url:https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.010", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.010", "record_id": "5393e173252292adb178d42f4821aa9f069a94ce250517fa8e4adca127dcec63", "source_version": "standalone:88891c9e3eda62a56df4530d792e358526f0dfa9fe4ad71111225ea79608179f", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.010"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2.html", "raw_sha256": "47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2", "source_url": "https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"SMC 1.01.020\" data-history=\"/SMC/1.01.020/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.020\" id=\"1.01.020\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/SMC/1.01.020/search\" data-share=\"/SMC/1.01.020/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 421px; min-height: 64px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.020</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Title – Citation – Reference.\">Title – Citation – Reference.</span></h6></header>\n<p>This code <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(H)\">shall</a> be known as the “Sonoma Municipal Code,” and it <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(H)\">shall</a> be sufficient to refer to this code as the “Sonoma Municipal Code” in any prosecution for the violation of any provision thereof or in any proceeding at <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(E)\">law</a> or equity. It <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(H)\">shall</a> be sufficient to designate any <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinances</a> adding to, amending, correcting or repealing all or any part or portion thereof as an addition to, amendment to, correction or repeal of the “Sonoma Municipal Code” and such references <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(H)\">shall</a> apply to that numbered title, chapter, section or subsection as it appears in the code. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 496 § 2, 1975).</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.1", "node_id": "url:https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.020", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.020", "record_id": "3f17ac0eb69e816cf5a5b85bdffbc86e8a810e9a29a37760a2102efc478b2dac", "source_version": "standalone:88891c9e3eda62a56df4530d792e358526f0dfa9fe4ad71111225ea79608179f", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.020"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2.html", "raw_sha256": "47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2", "source_url": "https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"SMC 1.01.030\" data-history=\"/SMC/1.01.030/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.030\" id=\"1.01.030\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/SMC/1.01.030/search\" data-share=\"/SMC/1.01.030/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 421px; min-height: 64px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.030</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Codification authority.\">Codification authority.</span></h6></header>\n<p>This code consists of all the regulatory and penal <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinances</a> and certain of the administrative <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinances</a> of the <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(A)\">city</a> of Sonoma, California, codified pursuant to the provisions of Sections <span class=\"notcite\">50022.1</span> through <span class=\"notcite\">50022.8</span> and <span class=\"notcite\">50022.10</span> of the California Code Annotated. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 496 § 3, 1975).</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.1", "node_id": "url:https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.030", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.030", "record_id": "57bfc913590b3d21808ca1bc79db84294112994b5f1b0c4334a24f81f1e0e414", "source_version": "standalone:88891c9e3eda62a56df4530d792e358526f0dfa9fe4ad71111225ea79608179f", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.030"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2.html", "raw_sha256": "47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2", "source_url": "https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"SMC 1.01.040\" data-history=\"/SMC/1.01.040/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.040\" id=\"1.01.040\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/SMC/1.01.040/search\" data-share=\"/SMC/1.01.040/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 421px; min-height: 64px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.040</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Ordinances passed prior to adoption of the code.\">Ordinances passed prior to adoption of the code.</span></h6></header>\n<p>The last <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinance</a> included in this code was <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">Ordinance</a> <a class=\"enact\" data-controller=\"dynamodal\" href=\"/enactments/Ord488?product=SMC\" title=\"Ord. 488\">488</a>, passed March 11, 1974. The <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(O)\">following</a> <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinances</a>, passed subsequent to <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">Ordinance</a> <a class=\"enact\" data-controller=\"dynamodal\" href=\"/enactments/Ord488?product=SMC\" title=\"Ord. 488\">488</a>, but prior to adoption of this code, are adopted and made a part of this code: <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">Ordinances</a> <a class=\"enact\" data-controller=\"dynamodal\" href=\"/enactments/Ord490?product=SMC\" title=\"Ord. 490\">490</a>, <a class=\"enact\" data-controller=\"dynamodal\" href=\"/enactments/Ord491?product=SMC\" title=\"Ord. 491\">491</a>, <a class=\"enact\" data-controller=\"dynamodal\" href=\"/enactments/Ord492?product=SMC\" title=\"Ord. 492\">492</a>, <a class=\"enact\" data-controller=\"dynamodal\" href=\"/enactments/Ord494?product=SMC\" title=\"Ord. 494\">494</a>, <a class=\"enact\" data-controller=\"dynamodal\" href=\"/enactments/Ord75-1?product=SMC\" title=\"Ord. 75-1\">75-1</a> and <a class=\"enact\" data-controller=\"dynamodal\" href=\"/enactments/Ord75-2?product=SMC\" title=\"Ord. 75-2\">75-2</a>. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 496 § 4, 1975).</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.1", "node_id": "url:https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.040", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.040", "record_id": "0e01c559e4a8999e19d1541b9c3a4a11e86b725e8938668b696c6bd647f8ff95", "source_version": "standalone:88891c9e3eda62a56df4530d792e358526f0dfa9fe4ad71111225ea79608179f", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.040"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2.html", "raw_sha256": "47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2", "source_url": "https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"SMC 1.01.050\" data-history=\"/SMC/1.01.050/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.050\" id=\"1.01.050\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/SMC/1.01.050/search\" data-share=\"/SMC/1.01.050/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 421px; min-height: 64px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.050</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Reference applies to all amendments.\">Reference applies to all amendments.</span></h6></header>\n<p>Whenever a reference is made to this code as the “Sonoma Municipal Code” or to any portion thereof, or to any <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinance</a> of the <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(A)\">city</a> of Sonoma, California, the reference <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(H)\">shall</a> apply to all amendments, corrections and additions heretofore, now or hereafter made. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 496 § 5, 1975).</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.1", "node_id": "url:https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.050", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.050", "record_id": "6eb8ef9fe8856988c868f8fd97902a7d098a726a4fa9c017a215834527a2d614", "source_version": "standalone:88891c9e3eda62a56df4530d792e358526f0dfa9fe4ad71111225ea79608179f", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.050"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2.html", "raw_sha256": "47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2", "source_url": "https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"SMC 1.01.060\" data-history=\"/SMC/1.01.060/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.060\" id=\"1.01.060\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/SMC/1.01.060/search\" data-share=\"/SMC/1.01.060/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 421px; min-height: 64px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.060</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Title, chapter and section headings.\">Title, chapter and section headings.</span></h6></header>\n<p>Title, chapter and section headings contained in this code <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(H)\">shall</a> not be deemed to govern, limit, modify or in any manner affect the scope, meaning or intent of the provisions of any title, chapter or section of this code. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 496 § 6, 1975).</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.1", "node_id": "url:https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.060", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.060", "record_id": "f7830303dd81f9b366da55dca3952c1eeae68136b96bbfd48575702e05926bcd", "source_version": "standalone:88891c9e3eda62a56df4530d792e358526f0dfa9fe4ad71111225ea79608179f", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.060"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2.html", "raw_sha256": "47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2", "source_url": "https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"SMC 1.01.070\" data-history=\"/SMC/1.01.070/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.070\" id=\"1.01.070\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/SMC/1.01.070/search\" data-share=\"/SMC/1.01.070/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 421px; min-height: 64px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.070</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Reference to specific ordinances.\">Reference to specific ordinances.</span></h6></header>\n<p>The provisions of this code <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(H)\">shall</a> not in any manner affect matters of record which refer to or are otherwise connected with <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinances</a> which are therein specifically designated by number or otherwise and which are included within the code, but such reference <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(H)\">shall</a> be construed to apply to the corresponding provisions contained within this code. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 496 § 7, 1975).</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.1", "node_id": "url:https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.070", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.070", "record_id": "84d0f0ebc86f12b664ec46ad2a744e033eabc23ecfe149692c5b0ea9b0605cf6", "source_version": "standalone:88891c9e3eda62a56df4530d792e358526f0dfa9fe4ad71111225ea79608179f", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.070"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2.html", "raw_sha256": "47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2", "source_url": "https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"SMC 1.01.080\" data-history=\"/SMC/1.01.080/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.080\" id=\"1.01.080\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/SMC/1.01.080/search\" data-share=\"/SMC/1.01.080/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 421px; min-height: 64px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.080</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Effect of code on past actions and obligations.\">Effect of code on past actions and obligations.</span></h6></header>\n<p>Neither the adoption of this code nor the repeal or amendments hereby of any <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinance</a> or part or portion of any <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinance</a> of the <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(A)\">city</a> <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(H)\">shall</a> in any manner affect the prosecution for violations of <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinances</a>, which violations were committed prior to the effective date of this code, nor be construed as a waiver of any license, fee or penalty at the effective date due and unpaid under such <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinances</a>, nor be construed as affecting any of the provisions of such <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinances</a> relating to the collection of any such license, fee or penalty, or the penal provisions applicable to any violation thereof, nor to affect the validity of any bond or cash deposit in lieu thereof required to be posted, filed or deposited pursuant to any <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinance</a>, and all rights and obligations thereunder appertaining <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(H)\">shall</a> continue in full force and effect. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 496 § 8, 1975).</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.1", "node_id": "url:https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.080", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.080", "record_id": "38d7e8efd85f97df1cf6486d4ba5cb3791754ddc74c418ae3838511c3461c24a", "source_version": "standalone:88891c9e3eda62a56df4530d792e358526f0dfa9fe4ad71111225ea79608179f", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.080"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2.html", "raw_sha256": "47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2", "source_url": "https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"SMC 1.01.090\" data-history=\"/SMC/1.01.090/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.090\" id=\"1.01.090\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/SMC/1.01.090/search\" data-share=\"/SMC/1.01.090/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 421px; min-height: 64px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.090</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Effective date.\">Effective date.</span></h6></header>\n<p>This code <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(H)\">shall</a> become effective on the date the <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinance</a> codified in this chapter adopting this code as the “Sonoma Municipal Code” becomes effective as provided by <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(E)\">law</a>. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 496 § 9, 1975).</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.1", "node_id": "url:https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.090", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.090", "record_id": "88cf08efafeac64bdb5bdc406c3e055b1855ae236883d33b072eaf709d573d24", "source_version": "standalone:88891c9e3eda62a56df4530d792e358526f0dfa9fe4ad71111225ea79608179f", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.090"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2.html", "raw_sha256": "47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2", "source_url": "https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.010"}]}
{"content_html": "<article class=\"level6 chunking-small type-Section has-history\" data-cite=\"SMC 1.01.100\" data-history=\"/SMC/1.01.100/history\" data-short-cite=\"1.01.100\" id=\"1.01.100\"><header class=\"full-header\" data-levelnodes-target=\"header\" data-search=\"/SMC/1.01.100/search\" data-share=\"/SMC/1.01.100/share\" data-type=\"Section\" style=\"top: 421px; min-height: 64px;\"><h6 class=\"inner-header\"><span class=\"num\">1.01.100</span> <span class=\"name\" title=\"Constitutionality.\">Constitutionality.</span></h6></header>\n<p>If any section, subsection, sentence, clause or phrase of this code is for any reason held to be invalid or unconstitutional, such decision <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(H)\">shall</a> not affect the validity of the remaining portions of this code. The <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(C)\">council</a> declares that it would have passed this code, and each section, subsection, sentence, clause and phrase thereof, irrespective of the fact that any one or more sections, subsections, clauses or phrases had been declared invalid or unconstitutional, and if for any reason this code should be declared invalid or unconstitutional, then the original <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinance</a> or <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(K)\">ordinances</a> <a class=\"def\" href=\"1.04.010(H)\">shall</a> be in full force and effect. <span class=\"note history history--linked\" data-action=\"click-&gt;levelnodes#openHistory\">(Ord. 496 § 10, 1975).</span></p>\n</article>", "extraction_version": "municipal-codes-validation-1.1", "node_id": "url:https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.100", "publisher_node_id": "dom:1.01.100", "record_id": "89d131ed05eb7eefc6edc60de7ac1eae36e7b3f2ff4e9b275ac6dcaaf6b9cc69", "source_version": "standalone:88891c9e3eda62a56df4530d792e358526f0dfa9fe4ad71111225ea79608179f", "sources": [{"locator": {"attribute": "id", "kind": "html-id", "value": "1.01.100"}, "raw_artifact_path": "raw/47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2.html", "raw_sha256": "47ab67a7b826f67df27878207da34959c5a65a539989ecdae1b7031fd27e4da2", "source_url": "https://sonoma.municipal.codes/SMC/1.01.010"}]}
